Hi,

the attached is a patch to add a pitch control for each pcm playback
stream.  when you play a pcm, a control "Emu10k1 PCM Pitch" on mixer.
this allows to change the current pitch (sample rate) on the fly.
the value is in Hz from 4000 to 96000.  (i'm not sure whether sb live
accepts the rate higher than 48000, but on audigy it works.)

unfortuantely alsamixer can adjust the values only roughly in 10%, but
theoretically you can adjust the pitch in 1 Hz resolution.

anyway, this is somewhat "just for fun".  if you feel it's useful,
let me know.  i'll consider to put it to cvs.
i think, however, that a generic api which bound to pcm such like in
ASIO or EASI would be more useful.  yep, time to discuss about it
again...

btw, a similar thing can be implemented for other cards, such like
trident. 


ciao,

Takashi

